Package: libfprint-goodixtls-55a4
Architecture: amd64
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: libfprint-2-2 (= ${binary:Version}), libfprint-2-tod1 (= ${binary:Version})
Conflicts: libfprint-2-2, libfprint-2-tod1
Replaces: libfprint-2-2, libfprint-2-tod1
Description: libfprint with the goodixtls driver for the Goodix 27c6:55a4 reader
 libfprint 1.94.6 from the TheWeirdDev 55b4-experimental fork with the goodixtls
 driver and the SIGFM (OpenCV) matcher, plus the patches from
 jith/goodix-55a4-fingerprint implementing the Windows-driver capture flow for
 the Goodix 27c6:55a4 fingerprint reader (Lenovo ThinkPad E14 Gen 1) running
 Lenovo's universal firmware GF32xx_RTSEC_APP_10062.
 .
 This package REPLACES the distribution libfprint (libfprint-2-2 / Ubuntu's
 libfprint-2-tod1): same soname libfprint-2.so.2, fprintd keeps working. The
 version number is chosen so that the distribution fprintd's dependency is
 satisfied; the actual upstream base is libfprint 1.94.6.
 .
 The reader must be paired with the community Linux PSK first (see the project
 README); the driver itself never writes to the sensor.

